\"100%\">\r\n<div id=\"dv_15\" class=\"blk_wrapper\">\r\n<table class=\"blk\" border=\"0\" width=\"600\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"tblCellMain\" style=\"padding: 35px 0px;\">\r\n<table class=\"tblLine\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-top-color: #e2e2e2; border-top-style: solid; min-width: 1px;\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"dv_8\" class=\"blk_wrapper\">\r\n<table class=\"blk\" border=\"0\" width=\"600\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<table class=\"bmeContainerRow\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th class=\"tdPart\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<table class=\"tblText\" style=\"float: left; background-color: transparent;\" border=\"0\" width=\"600\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"left\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"tblCell\" style=\"padding: 10px 20px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; color: #383838; text-align: left; word-break: break-word;\" align=\"left\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<div style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: xx-large; line-height: 150%;\"><strong>您的生產工廠 像黑箱嗎？</strong></span></h2>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 150%;\"><strong>您是否多年使用會計系統或進銷存系統，仍無法管控工廠的生產進度嗎？</strong></span>\r\n\r\n鼎捷生產進度管理方案能在不更換現有系統下，解決您多年來的的困擾！\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"dv_6\" class=\"blk_wrapper\">\r\n<table class=\"blk\" style=\"width: 600px;\" border=\"0\" width=\"600\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<table class=\"bmeCapti